00 meters just a few minutes  after takeoff and crashed near the city  of pur and US officials claimed the  aircraft was hit by a missile possibly a  russian-made tore m1 Tehran dismissed  the missile theory as illogical rumor  but Ukraine wants independent answers  and has sent its own team of  investigators the task is clear to  understand what happened  unfortunately for today we cannot know  for sure whether it was a terrorist act  or whether it was some other event our  task is to put an end to this issue  they'll want access to this what appears  to be the black box flight recorder  Britain too is urging a credible and  transparent investigation for British  nationals were among the 176 people on  board the plane if a missile strike is  confirmed it would be a huge  embarrassment for Iran it would also be  another tragic twist in it bitter  dispute with America  Deborah Haynes Sky News
 

